# ex35 outer row (mirrors demos/7-tiers/35-two-habitats.bqn)
# a = 1 2 3 at rows 0-2, b = 10 20 at rows 3-4, concatenated into val; masks A and B mark the slices.
# f is the comprehension body: the id-indexed sum over the concatenated layout.
n 5
col val num 1 2 3 10 20
col a bool 1 1 1 0 0
col b bool 0 0 0 1 1
fn f {(𝕨⊑val)+𝕩⊑val}
lattice 4 4
ja 前 prev
ja 行 row
ja 番号 index
ja 字 char
